{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20215","headline":"哀孟云卿嵩阳荒居 · 孟郊","name":"哀孟云卿嵩阳荒居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"戚戚抱幽独，宴宴沈荒居。\n不闻新欢笑，但覩旧诗书。\n艺蘖意弥苦，耕山食无余。\n定交昔何在，至戚今或疎。\n薄俗易销歇，淳风难久舒。\n秋芜上空堂，寒槿落枯渠。\n薙草恐伤蕙，摄衣自理锄。\n残芳亦可饵，遗秀谁忍除。\n徘徊未能去，爲尔涕涟如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20215.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20215","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}